{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37719","headline":"远游 · 郑谷","name":"远游","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江湖犹足事，食宿戍鼙喧。\n久客秋风起，孤舟夜浪翻。\n乡音离楚水，庙貌入湘源。\n岸阔凫鷖小，林垂橘柚繁。\n津官来有意，渔者笑无言。\n早晚酬僧约，中条有药园。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37719.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37719","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}